  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily and Leo are in an apartment. It is Grandma's home. \"Let's play a game,\" says Lily. \"I have a toy animal.\" \"It is behind the armchair.\" \"Is it a cat?\" asks Leo. \"No, it isn't.\"",
      "\"Is it a lizard?\" \"No, it isn't.\" \"Is it a jellyfish?\" Lily smiles. \"No, it isn't.\" \"Is it big?\" \"No, it is small.\" \"Are they mice?\" asks Leo.",
      "\"Yes, they are!\" Lily has two toy mice. They are gray. \"Good game!\" says Leo. \"Now you play.\" Leo has a toy. \"Is it a frog?\" asks Lily."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily hides a toy animal behind an armchair in Grandma's apartment. Leo asks yes or no questions and finds two gray mice.",
